<li>Mom Chao Phannarai&lt;br&gt;Putri Phannarai&lt;br&gt;(29 April 1839 – 25 November 1900)</li>
<li>Phra Sambandhawongse Ther Phra Ong Chao Phannarai&lt;br&gt;Yang Mulia Putri Phannarai&lt;br&gt;(25 November 1900 – 22 Juni 1914)</li>
</ul>
